ms: 126 (504.00 B)\r\n Non-trainable params: 0 (0.00 B)\r\n...\r\nInput 0 of layer \"dense\" is incompatible with the layer: expected axis -1 of input shape to have value 40, but received input with shape (1, 56)\r\n\r\nArguments received by Functional.call():\r\n  \u2022 inputs=tf.Tensor(shape=(1, 8, 4), dtype=float32)\r\n  \u2022 training=False\r\n  \u2022 mask=None\r\n```\r\n\r\nBasically, during model build, the dense() layer expect input of shape(40,), but receive shape(56,) during execution.\r\n",
